amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322260/extras/17bdf94ecd9f62a49f30b9b60a126309.poster.avif?t=1771680395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322260/extras/17bdf94ecd9f62a49f30b9b60a126309.webm?t=1771680395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322260/extras/17bdf94ecd9f62a49f30b9b60a126309.mp4?t=1771680395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The true face of the Orcs:</strong> play as the Orcs, the most feared creatures of the land</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Procedurally generated environments:</strong> stumble upon strange characters, lost treasures, secrets, and dangerous foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the horde your way:</strong> build, decorate, and outfit your clan for style and glory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique hand-drawn style:</strong> gritty hand-drawn artwork to feel the rage in your raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And one last time: </strong>Don\u2019t Kill Them All!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Fika Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322260/669accaf9c867df01a997356ed228f1a6900aad7/header.jpg?t=1771680395","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Fika Productions. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><